cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioCode Lab in teaching, training, or research, please cite this software."
title: "BioCode Lab"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-03
authors:
  - family-names: "Cardenas Conejo"
    given-names: "Yair"
abstract: >-
  BioCode Lab is a bilingual, gamified, story-driven learning environment
  for undergraduate biology students that integrates Python foundations,
  command-line skills, FASTA file handling, sys.argv, Biopython, and
  introductory bioinformatics workflows in a single HTML application.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - Python
  - Biopython
  - command line
  - biology education
  - programming education
  - open educational resource
license: MIT
